@startuml
title OmniTrade AI - UML run state machine
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> Queued : accepted configuration
Queued --> Running : worker starts
Running --> Pausing : pause requested
Pausing --> Paused : safe batch complete / checkpoint saved
Paused --> Queued : resume accepted / credentials rechecked
Running --> Cancelling : cancel requested
Pausing --> Cancelling : cancel requested
Paused --> Cancelling : cancel requested
Cancelling --> Cancelled : control observed
Running --> Interrupted : worker/process lost
Interrupted --> Queued : recoverable resume
Running --> Failed : required failure / deadlock / exhausted budget
Failed --> Queued : legal retry from checkpoint
Running --> Succeeded : all required work complete
Running --> Degraded : report complete with disclosed optional loss
Succeeded --> [*]
Degraded --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of Paused
Completed node outputs remain immutable.
Old live runs require reconnected session capabilities.
end note
note right of Cancelled
Cancellation is final and cannot resume.
end note
@enduml
